/Title (Beyond the two flagged loans, large maturing loans dominated August's transfer activity. They included the New York office loans 111 Livingston Street and 60 Madison Avenue, the lodging loan Hyatt Regency New Orleans, and retail loans such as the Fresno Fashion Fair Mall and Harlem USA. Most carried imminent balloon or maturity default as the transfer reason rather than payment distress. Several were still current at transfer emphasizing the maturity and refinancing pressure this month.)
